--- !u!114 &93469538
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 93469537}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e36a870d2757d1145a04fb9536d0beb4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueManager
  dialogueLines:
  - name: 
    text: Go ahead and try it now, if you want.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: Whenever you're done with that, though, I guess I should show you how to
      cut hair.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'I would love to let you practice on my hair, but unfortunately, it''s
      already too glorious '
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'It''s also intangible ghost hair, so it wouldn''t work either way. '
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'I could just let you cut up one of your father''s wigs, but I have a better
      idea, wait here. '
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 1
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 1
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: Ok, I got one!
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 0
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: I posessed this tourist from the street, you can practice cutting hair
      on her!
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: If you run out, just ask me to give her more hair. I can do that now. Because
      I'm a ghost.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 1
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: The first thing you need to know is the scissors, drag the scissors onto
      the hair, and try to only cut the parts that the client indicates.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 'Next, you should know how to wet and dry your client''s hair. '
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: Just drag the shower head onto the hair to wet it, and do the same with
      the towel to dry it.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: I think that's pretty much all I can teach you now, so mess around with
      it a bit more until you're comfortable, then you can go right to your first
      day.
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  - name: 
    text: 
    uncleSpeaking: 1
    dadSpeaking: 0
    removeButtonsOnStart: 0
    hasRemovedButtons: 0
    SpawnRed: 0
    hasSpawnedRed: 0
    SpawnDad: 0
    hasSpawnedDad: 0
    SpawnSubmit: 0
    hasSpawnedSubmit: 0
    waterTrigger: 0
    purpleTrigger: 0
    MoveCamera: 0
    hasMovedCamera: 0
    spawnHairCustomer: 1
    hasSpawnedHairCustomer: 0
  nextButton: {fileID: 1195183071}
  backButton: {fileID: 1245142687}
  typingDelay: 0.05
  redBottle: {fileID: 2092305659}
  dad: {fileID: 1564906996}
